    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Make Tracks Great Again\uff1a</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a simulation management game about how to Make Tracks Great Again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is only one goal:</strong> make money, make money, make money. You need to earn more each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to make money?:</strong> Dispatch a train of the corresponding color to the platform based on the cargo color of the truck, wait until the train is fully loaded and departs. You'll earn a huge sum once the train leaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If:</strong> No train matching the cargo color is available at the platform, the truck will leave with the cargo, resulting in a massive fine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, this railway station stood as the greatest, most profitable, and most incredible transportation hub in the nation\u2014without equal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For decades it operated in glorious efficiency, with cities daily vying to pack our freight cars to the brim. The volume of orders back then was so overwhelming that the rails nearly buckled under the strain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day\u2014no one understood why\u2014certain individuals began destroying it all with catastrophically poor decisions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our debts now outnumber the bolts on these rails, and liquidation agents are smirking on the platforms, calculators in hand! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Many Steps to Fit an Elephant into a Refrigerator?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No.1:Lift the barrier gate to allow the truck access to the station</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/7840255e53b3402a0f0048207df173fd.poster.avif?t=1748663979\" width=426 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/7840255e53b3402a0f0048207df173fd.webm?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/7840255e53b3402a0f0048207df173fd.mp4?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No.2:Select a train matching the cargo\u2019s color</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/0a61d3ce3b34b5dab5b4598f73420e8c.poster.avif?t=1748663979\" width=426 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/0a61d3ce3b34b5dab5b4598f73420e8c.webm?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/0a61d3ce3b34b5dab5b4598f73420e8c.mp4?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No.3:Wait for the cargo to be loaded</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/c59bab8a4432d8b81136984e9f97e7cd.poster.avif?t=1748663979\" width=426 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/c59bab8a4432d8b81136984e9f97e7cd.webm?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/c59bab8a4432d8b81136984e9f97e7cd.mp4?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No.4:Wait for the train to be fully loaded and depart the station</strong><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/c4f32d2e8b04f0eade7781d022c9381e.poster.avif?t=1748663979\" width=426 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/c4f32d2e8b04f0eade7781d022c9381e.webm?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/c4f32d2e8b04f0eade7781d022c9381e.mp4?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tasks required: Select trains matching the cargo\u2019s color, allocate trains on the tracks appropriately, control the opening and closing of barrier gates, and manage trucks entering the station.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 BUT!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Trucks departing with cargo will cause significant losses to the station!!!</strong><br><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/51275f93af4bcc341e3866a49f1dcbda.poster.avif?t=1748663979\" width=426 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/51275f93af4bcc341e3866a49f1dcbda.webm?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/51275f93af4bcc341e3866a49f1dcbda.mp4?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Hold on\uff1a</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>&quot;Listen up, rookie. You\u2019re the new acting stationmaster now, and this is an \u2018absolutely simple\u2019 job! Use your astonishing talents to make tracks great again!</u><br><br><br><br><u>(Trust me, everyone who\u2019s ever believed in me calls this the greatest slogan in history.) Before you, 73 acting agents briefly restored the station to glory\u2014for about five minutes. And then?  </u>  <br> <u>This place ended up buried under new debt! Guess what happened to those losers? </u>  <br><u>Oh, and right now, dozens of self-proclaimed \u2018genius\u2019 agents are working in other offices, competing against you in real time. So, which of you will prove to be the top agent?&quot;</u>\u2014<strong>Boss</strong></p></li></ul>",
