i.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646650/extras/51275f93af4bcc341e3866a49f1dcbda.mp4?t=1748663979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Hold on\uff1a</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>&quot;Listen up, rookie. You\u2019re the new acting stationmaster now, and this is an \u2018absolutely simple\u2019 job! Use your astonishing talents to make tracks great again!</u><br><br><br><br><u>(Trust me, everyone who\u2019s ever believed in me calls this the greatest slogan in history.) Before you, 73 acting agents briefly restored the station to glory\u2014for about five minutes. And then?  </u>  <br> <u>This place ended up buried under new debt! Guess what happened to those losers? </u>  <br><u>Oh, and right now, dozens of self-proclaimed \u2018genius\u2019 agents are working in other offices, competing against you in real time. So, which of you will prove to be the top agent?&quot;</u>\u2014<strong>Boss</strong></p></li></ul>",
